],"outputs":[],"properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["根据需求切换 提示词和lora\n\n---------------------------\n▶去字幕（字幕移除和文本叠加清理）\n▶ltx2.3-ic-subtitles-remove-general.safetensors\t\n●提示词\nRemove subtitles, captions, and related text occlusions from the video, restoring a clean and natural underlying image. \n\n---------------------------\n▶去水印（水印去除和遮挡感知重建）\n▶ltx2.3-ic-watermark-remove-general.safetensors\t\n●提示词\nRemove short-video platform watermarks and related occlusions from the video, restoring a clean, clear, and natural original image.\n去除视频画面中的短视频平台水印与字幕与相关遮挡痕迹，恢复干净、清晰、自然的原始画面；保持人物、场景、动作、镜头运动、时序和整体风格一致，不改变原视频内容，只进行水印和字幕的去除与细节修复。\n\n---------------------------\n▶高清化（视频高清增强、超分辨率和细节恢复）\n▶ltx2.3-ic-video-upscale-general.safetensors\n●提示词\nConvert the video to ultra-high-definition quality, significantly improving clarity, fine detail richness, texture fidelity, and overall perceptual sharpness.\n将视频转换为超高清画质，大幅提升画面清晰度与细节丰富度，增强色彩表现力与纹理细节。\n\n---------------------------\n▶去模糊（视频修复、伪影清除、模糊和噪点恢复）\n▶ltx2.3-video-restoration-general.safetensors\t\n●提示词\nConvert the video to ultra-high-definition quality while removing artifacts and rebuilding high-frequency details.\n将视频转换为超高清画质，在消除伪影的同时重建高频细节，显著提升画面清晰度。\n\n"],"color":"#ad412e","bgcolor":"#992d1a"},{"id":706,"type":"VAEDecodeTiled","pos":[-4120.219003567035,-806.7148020715796],"size":[210,150],"flags":{},"order":44,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"samples","localized_name":"Latent","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":1072},{"label":"vae","localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":1073},{"label":"tile_size","localized_name":"分块尺寸","name":"tile_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"tile_size"},"link":null},{"label":"overlap","localized_name":"重叠","name":"overlap","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"overlap"},"link":null},{"label":"temporal_size","localized_name":"时间尺寸","name":"temporal_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"temporal_size"},"li